SELECT County_of_Residence, EXTRACT(YEAR FROM year) AS year, Births
FROM `bigquery-public-data.sdoh_cdc_wonder_natality.county_natality` 
WHERE CAST(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM year) AS INT64) BETWEEN 2016 AND 2018
  AND County_of_Residence IN ('Erie County, NY','Niagara County, NY', 'Chautauqua County, NY')
ORDER BY Births DESC


## Orders Most to Least Births from 2016 - 2018 in Countries: Erie, Niagara, Chautauqua 
## I learned that since year is a date, so need to cast to change the type to integer since 2016 and 2018 are both integers 
